message: "If you use or reference the Echo Protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "Echo Protocol: open coordination specification for community-owned AI inference nodes"
abstract: "An open coordination specification governing how distributed AI inference nodes discover each other, advertise capabilities, route requests via typed agent handoffs, and synchronize verified software and model state — designed for community-owned infrastructure under unreliable rural network conditions."
